==Serbo-Croatian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|uza}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*vъz-}} ({{cog|ru|воз-}}, {{cog|pl|wz-}}). Cognate with {{cog|lt|už}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|unaccented}} {{IPA|/uz/|lang=sh}}

===Preposition===
{{sh-preposition}}

# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[up]], [[upward]]
#: {{ux|sh|ići uz stepenice|t=to go upstairs|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|uz brdo|t=uphill|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|uz r(ij)eku|t=upriver|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|peti/penjati se uz konopac|t=to climb a rope|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[next]] to, [[beside]], [[by]]
#: {{ux|sh|uz cestu|t=next to the road|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|uza samu granicu|t=on the very border|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[with]], [[along]] with (circumstances or conditions accompanying the action)
#: {{ux|sh|uz sm(ij)eh/plač|t=while laughing/crying|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|uz p(j)esmu|t=while singing|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|uz piće|t=while drinking, while having a drink|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|p(j)evati uz klavir|t=to sing while the piano is playing|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|with accusative}} [[in spite of]], [[despite]] (={{m|sh|pȍred}})
#: {{ux|sh|uza sve to|t=despite all that|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
The variant form {{m|sh|uza}} is used before enclitics and consonants which would make it difficult to pronounce.

====Related terms====
* {{l|sh|uz-}}

